sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    %% PATHWAY.ECO — Workflow 2: Recruiter Job Publishing & 30-Day Scheduled Expiration
    
    actor Recruiter as Recruiter Portal (:3002)
    actor Cron as Scheduled HTTP Cron Runner
    actor Candidate as Candidate Portal (:3000)
    participant MW as Edge Middleware
    participant Auth as ServerAuth Guard
    participant RBAC as RecruiterRbacService
    participant Zod as Zod Engine
    participant JobService as RecruiterJobService
    participant ExpService as JobExpirationService
    participant DB as Prisma / MongoDB

    Recruiter->>MW: POST /api/recruiter/jobs (Cookie: career_recruiter_session)
    MW->>Auth: Pass through route (valid cookie)
    Auth->>DB: Resolve Recruiter & Company membership
    DB-->>Auth: Recruiter active, company: auth.company.id
    Auth->>RBAC: assertPermission(auth, 'jobs:create')
    Auth->>RBAC: assertPermission(auth, 'jobs:publish')
    RBAC-->>Auth: RBAC privileges verified
    Auth->>Zod: RecruiterJobCreateSchema.parse(payload)
    Zod-->>JobService: Validated typed job data
    
    JobService->>JobService: Calculate timestamps (publishedAt = now, expiresAt = now + 30d)
    JobService->>DB: db.job.create({ status: 'PUBLISHED', publishedAt, expiresAt, companyId })
    DB-->>JobService: Job record committed
    JobService->>DB: AuditLog JOB_CREATED & JOB_PUBLISHED
    JobService-->>Recruiter: HTTP 201 Created { job: JobDTO }

    Candidate->>DB: GET /api/jobs (Query status == PUBLISHED && publishedAt > now - 30d)
    DB-->>Candidate: Job listed on public search board

    Note over Cron, ExpService: Daily Scheduled HTTP Cron Trigger (Vercel Cron / External Runner)
    Cron->>MW: GET /api/jobs/cron/expire (Authorization: Bearer CRON_SECRET)
    MW->>ExpService: Validate CRON_SECRET or Admin Session
    ExpService->>ExpService: Compute cutoff threshold = new Date(now - 30 days)
    ExpService->>DB: db.job.updateMany({ status: 'EXPIRED' where publishedAt <= cutoff })
    DB-->>ExpService: result { count: updatedJobsCount }
    ExpService-->>Cron: HTTP 200 OK { success: true, updatedCount, threshold, timestamp }

    Candidate->>MW: POST /api/jobs/:id/apply (Attempting to apply to expired job)
    MW->>ExpService: isJobExpired(job) check in ApplicationService
    ExpService-->>Candidate: HTTP 400 Bad Request ("This job is no longer accepting applications.")
    Note over Recruiter, DB: Recruiter reviews existing applicants; historical pipeline intact
